WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.730
Everything is made of tiny particles that never stop moving.

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:08.310
In a solid, they are packed in fixed places, just vibrating.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:12.410
Heat it, and they slide past each other: a liquid.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:17.680
Heat more, and they fly apart to fill the space: a gas.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.200
Same particles, different motion.

